name: Riff-Raff — common factory
author: corpus
description: >-
  Riff-Raff creates 2 Common Jokers when a Blind is selected. First-shop slot filler:
  feeds Abstract Joker (+3 Mult per Joker), Swashbuckler (sell value → Mult), and
  Showman (duplicate common engines).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: RiffRaff
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: AbstractJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Swashbuckler
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 25
